{
  "id": "unique-event-014",
  "paragraphs": [
    {
      "id": "unique-event-014:p0000",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "#14 - speeding train\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[83,686,707]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-014:p0001",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "You rush to the door and force it\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[83,707,741]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-014:p0002",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "open. The train is already picking\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[83,741,776]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-014:p0003",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "up speed. Save vs. L5 (add +1 if you\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[83,776,813]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-014:p0004",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "have the Agile Skill, or +2 if you\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[83,813,848]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-014:p0005",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "have it at the Expert level) to land\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[83,848,885]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-014:p0006",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "safely. If you fail, you lose 1 Life\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[83,885,922]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-014:p0007",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "and 1 item of your choice (but not\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[83,922,957]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-014:p0008",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "a cursed item or a Clown mask). If\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[83,957,992]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-014:p0009",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "you pass the roll, you land with\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[83,992,1025]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-014:p0010",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "nothing more than a few bruises.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[83,1025,1058]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-014:p0011",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "The train zooms away, engulfed in\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[83,1058,1092]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-014:p0012",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "a cloud of blackness. Probably,\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[83,1092,1124]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-014:p0013",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "jumping off was a good choice.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[83,1124,1155]]"
    }
  ],
  "sourcePages": [
    83
  ]
}
